NOTICE_models
=============

This repository distributes artifacts derived from Meta's Llama models.
It does not distribute any Llama model weights, tokenizer or code; users
obtain the models directly from Hugging Face.

Models used
-----------
  meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct   (target)  Llama 3.1 Community License
  meta-llama/Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct   (draft)   Llama 3.2 Community License

Classifier heads
----------------
The following files are the parameters of small logistic-regression
classifiers trained on internal representations obtained by running inputs
through the Llama models above:

  verifier_general/Llama-3.1-8B-self-logistic-num20.pkl
  verifier_general/Llama-3.1-8B-auto-logistic.pkl

Mined datasets
--------------
The mined important-token datasets for the Llama draft/target pair, which
are distributed separately (see README), contain per record: the source
prompt; the full generation of Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct as text and token ids,
including the mismatching Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct draft tokens; hidden-state
vectors extracted from Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct at the mismatch positions; and
likelihood scores. They are provided for reproducing the classifier heads
and are subject to the corresponding Llama Community Licenses and
Acceptable Use Policies. The prompts are taken from GSM8K, LiveCodeBench
and Dolly-15k and remain under their own licenses; full attribution is in
the NOTICE_dataset.txt distributed alongside the files.

